Installation
Go to the Releases section of this GitHub repository.
Download AI.exe.
Run AI.exe and follow the on-screen instructions.
The program will automatically handle the required setup, model installation, Ollama/Open WebUI configuration, and shortcut creation.

Windows: If Windows Defender/SmartScreen shows a warning, verify that you downloaded AI.exe from this repository's official Releases page before allowing it to run. You can disble defender temporarily and re-enable it after completing installation.
